<title>MEXICO: Mexico to offer 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes next week.</title>
<headline>Mexico to offer 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes next week.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said on Friday it would auction 3.0 billion pesos worth of Cetes at its primary auction on Tuesday next week.</p>
<p>It will also auction a total of 1.2 billion pesos of one- and two-year Bondes.  </p>
<p>CETES</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    28  days     800 million pesos  20.57 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     800 million pesos  20.18 pct</p>
<p>    181 days     800 million pesos  19.39 pct</p>
<p>    364 days     600 million pesos  18.14 pct</p>
<p>BONDES</p>
<p>    364 days     500 million pesos  100.0 pct</p>
<p>    728 days     700 million pesos  100.0 pct</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom 525 728-7902))</p>
</text>
